'' THE PROGRAM'S OWN MANIFEST WINS. A '.rc' with '1 24 "file"' already gives the executable an
'' RT_MANIFEST; a second would be a duplicate resource at the link, so none is added. That
'' manifest says nothing about DPI, so the program is DPI-unaware (0): it is the one in force.
'' HOSTS: windows
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/manifest-dpi.bas tests/driver/src/manifest-own.rc -o tests/driver/manifestown.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE-HAS: tests/driver/manifestown.exe :: MANIFEST-OF-ITS-OWN
'' EXPECT-FILE-NOT-HAS: tests/driver/manifestown.exe :: PerMonitorV2
'' RUN: tests/driver/manifestown.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: awareness 0
